  "limitations": [
    "Independent complete two-commit diagnostic history, 28 original files and 347,007 bytes. Source refs/heads/master is mapped only to a new dedicated history ref, not any repository production/master/main ref. No new model, GLB, saved candidate or render is delivered. Old umbrella/seaside production refs and CURRENT remain unchanged.",
    "The frozen trial fixes the existing frame and end sections, using one author-chosen a=.97 vertical sag with maximum .2425, not pixel-measured physical cloth. It is REJECTED and NOT APPLIED. This conclusion does not reject the source curved-cloth category or all possible cloth constructions and does not introduce a new parameter search or frame/width change.",
    "Supplied independent records recompute 3225 finite parameter-volume samples per outer stripe/wood pair and verify inside points with actual 12-triangle solid-angle winding. On both outer stripes the reported back-rail counts are 130 to 596, cross-B counts 54 to 90, front-bar counts 30 to 40. These retain original penetration and its extension; they are not intersection volume, continuous maximum penetration, exhaustive whole-scene containment or mechanical safety metrics.",
    "The earlier analytic-sampling and unequal-tessellation evidence remains as recorded; final trial JSON is the piecewise-linear mesh sampling. The independent original check records script SHA6450c9..., while input-binding binds frozen script SHAb66e5f... and states only MODEL_PATH input support was added. Both hashes and their distinction remain intact. No old script, geometry or QA was rerun by this archiver.",
    "Four included PNGs are original-pixel chair crops and 3x nearest-neighbor inspection enlargements from two previously reported source images; not new native frames or renders. The full 03/04 WebP source images are external references and not delivered here. qa/immutable-input.json references prior umbrella e54037dbc36112a159065e7c2f33cd941cb9ac88 four models plus environment JSON, not repeated in this package. No fake ancestry to that production history is created.",
    "Video evidence includes the three original text files manifest.json, result.json and review.zh.md plus an explicit package-scope note. The original manifest also names actual-viewport.png, which is deliberately absent because it contains unrelated recommendations and no decoded scene. Its bytes are neither delivered nor claimed verified by this archive.",
    "Frozen playback records show menu 1080p availability but videoWidth/videoHeight 0x0, readyState0 and currentTime0 before and after one historical reload. UI0:05 is not decoded frame time. Cause remains unresolved technical playback; no access denial, CAPTCHA, login block or bot-ban diagnosis is inferred. No scene pixels, two angles, source acceptance or official date bridge follows from it. The archive did not retry playback or access the URL.",
    "Archive verification covers original bytes, manifest hashes, supplied-record bindings and all real Git objects/commit trees only. No production, QA, restoration, modeling or rendering scripts executed. All old paths and existing refs/CURRENT are compared unchanged. No LFS, ZIP, force push, history deletion, credentials copying, new permissions, security changes or Issue/PR operations. Previously denied source-screening-increment receipt remains paused. Space v0 is retained for parent confirmation."
